{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--wrap-up","name":"wrap-up","description":"Close out a launched Claude Managed Agent — recap every primitive the founder now owns, regenerate the single-file overview page, and suggest the next 1-2 upgrades. Use when the user says \"wrap up\", \"close this out\", \"what do I own now\", \"give me the summary\", \"recap the agent\", or when the orchestrator routes phase=wrap-up. primitives_inventory.py tables everything owned (agent, environment, session, memory, outcome, deployment); overview_page.py regenerates a self-contained ./my-agent/agent-overview.html; upgrade_suggester.py ranks the next moves from recorded deferrals plus standing hardening steps. Companion to run-without-you; the last stop before phase=done.","category":"Cloud & DevOps","tags":["wrap","up","close","out","launched","claude","managed","agent","recap","every","primitive","founder","now","owns","regenerate","single","file","overview"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"agent-launcher/skills/wrap-up","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/agent-launcher/skills/wrap-up","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":6,"bytes":17572,"sha256":"6e83891b547fcf7680d512e07f64cc68221c45ffa7ba3f8078035dd9fe54d5a5","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"README.md","sourcePath":"agent-launcher/skills/wrap-up/README.md","bytes":844,"sha256":"cd76f634e01efe69c000f9c81bcf27e82e8cd9d642c33441ac13a2c6c670c595","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/agent-launcher/skills/wrap-up/README.md"},{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"agent-launcher/skills/wrap-up/SKILL.md","bytes":3082,"sha256":"6e8389